WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Create your account. Confirm your email, then sign in with your email or username.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
After joining, use My SGC to find your purchases, access, meetings and personal library.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Discover learning material, useful guides and practical support for your next step.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Preview starter learning: clarify your idea, understand your customer and plan your first step.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An idea worksheet turns a big thought into a clear problem, a customer and one small action.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Choose a module, open a lesson and work through teaching, notes and quizzes where included. Access depends on your purchase.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Explore conversations, exchange ideas and find encouragement as you take your first steps.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Open a comment thread, reply to ideas and react to a message that encourages you.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Find your meetings, purchased kits, quiz results and saved learning portfolio in My SGC.

